OL,3,GNEWSAHalloween superfan's home giving
OL,4,Astreet a scare
OL,5,
OL,6,FHalloween superfan Andrzej Wojcik has
OL,7,Ftransformed his home into a showcase
OL,8,Ffor all things spooky.
OL,10,FThe tradition is one he has repeated,
OL,11,Fwith no fear, every Halloween for the
OL,12,Flast five years. His favourite part is
OL,13,Fhis 1969 Jeep Gladiator dressed with
OL,14,Fskeletons, lights and pumpkins.
OL,16,FA BBC timelapse video captured the
OL,17,Ftwo-day effort that went into creating
OL,18,Fthe display in Finchley Avenue,
OL,19,FMackworth, Derby.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
