OL,3,GNEWSAHalloween superfan's home giving
OL,4,Astreet a scare
OL,5,
OL,6,F"If I can do something, I like sharing
OL,7,Fit with others," Wojcik said. "I like
OL,8,Fto make other people happy and it makes
OL,9,Fme happy to see people enjoying my
OL,10,Fwork."
